                      (    forth6809.asm):02043         ; QUIT  ( -- ) ( R: i*x -- )
                      (    forth6809.asm):02044         ; Empty the return stack, set interpretation state, then loop reading
                      (    forth6809.asm):02045         ; a line and interpreting it under CATCH. Errors are reported as
