                      (    forth6809.asm):05236         ; Remainder of n1 divided by n2. Division truncates toward zero; the
                      (    forth6809.asm):05237         ; remainder has the sign of the dividend. THROW -10 if the divisor is
                      (    forth6809.asm):05238         ; zero.
